      "id": 234963,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-02-02T17:20:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, I feel validated. :)</p>\n<p>I'm so glad they went through the new mechanics keywords, those are easily my favorite thing about DE, and there's a whole thread on BGG where people were trying to do exactly that.</p>\n<p>Except the hero deck backs are actually my favorite thing.</p>\n<p>Also just all the new art.</p>\n<p>This episode makes me realize that I actually am really excited about Definitive Edition. Just the thought of all those new expansions on the horizon. It's not a financially viable choice for me to follow right now, but who knows, maybe in six years I can pick up all of it at once, just like I did with EE in the Oblivaeon Kickstarter.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:11:11.053Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 6,
