      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Well, I feel validated. :)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm so glad they went through the new mechanics keywords, those are easily my favorite thing about DE, and there's a whole thread on BGG where people were trying to do exactly that.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Except the hero deck backs are actually my favorite thing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also just all the new art.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This episode makes me realize that I actually am really excited about Definitive Edition. Just the thought of all those new expansions on the horizon. It's not a financially viable choice for me to follow right now, but who knows, maybe in six years I can pick up all of it at once, just like I did with EE in the Oblivaeon Kickstarter.</p>",
